          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/60 dark:text-blue-300 font-bold text-[11px] shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span>
            <div><strong>Dry Volume Calculation:</strong> ${lastResultData.wetVolCum} m³ × Dry Factor (${dryFactor}) × (1 + Wastage ${wastage}%) = <strong>${lastResultData.dryVolCum} m³</strong> (${lastResultData.dryVolCft} CFT)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-900/60 dark:text-blue-300 font-bold text-[11px] shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span>
            <div><strong>Cement Required (${lastResultData.ratioLabel} Mix):</strong> (${lastResultData.dryVolCum} × ${cPart}/${totalParts}) × 1440 kg/m³ = ${lastResultData.cementKg} kg ➔ <strong>${lastResultData.cementBagsRound} Bags</strong> (50kg)</div>
