            <div><strong>Coordinate Offsets:</strong> \u0394X (Easting) = ${x2} − ${x1} = <strong>${lastResultData.dx}m</strong> | \u0394Y (Northing) = ${y2} − ${y1} = <strong>${lastResultData.dy}m</strong></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800">
