            <div><strong>Euclidean Direct Distance:</strong> \u221A(${lastResultData.dx}\u00B2 + ${lastResultData.dy}\u00B2) = <strong>${lastResultData.distM} meters</strong> (${lastResultData.distKm} km)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800">
